+    /// Private protected correctness export. Uses the identical charged
+    /// recorder, then publishes a bounded CPU-only buffer synchronously after
+    /// bilateral retirement/lifecycle exit and before control.completed.
+    /// The publisher must not retain Data or the borrowed live-check closure.
+    @_spi(Benchmark) public func startRecording(requestID: UUID,
